      "explanation": "<p>Sure! A symmetric matrix is a square matrix that is equal to its transpose. For a matrix to be symmetric, the element at row i and column j must be equal to the element at row j and column i. In other words, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.666ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"9.208ex\" height=\"2.286ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -716 4070.1 1010.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D434\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D434\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(783,-150) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D456\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D456\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(345,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D457\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D457\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1646.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(2701.8,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D434\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D434\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(783,-150) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D457\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D457\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(412,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D456\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D456\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>. </p>\n<p>For a 3 <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0.02ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.09ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -491 778 482\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> 3 symmetric matrix, it looks like this:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -3.733ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"12.109ex\" height=\"8.597ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -2150 5352 3800\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"239B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-S4-239B\" transform=\"translate(0,996)\"></use><use data-c=\"239D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-S4-239D\" transform=\"translate(0,-1006)\"></use><svg width=\"875\" height=\"322\" y=\"89\" x=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 63.7 875 322\"><use data-c=\"239C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-S4-239C\" transform=\"scale(1,0.764)\"></use></svg></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtable\" transform=\"translate(875,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtr\" transform=\"translate(0,1400)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtd\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D44E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44E\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtd\" transform=\"translate(1576,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D44F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44F\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtd\" transform=\"translate(3110.5,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D450\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D450\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtr\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtd\" transform=\"translate(50,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D44F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44F\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtd\" transform=\"translate(1529,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtd\" transform=\"translate(3094,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D452\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D452\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtr\" transform=\"translate(0,-1400)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtd\" transform=\"translate(48,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D450\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D450\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtd\" transform=\"translate(1557.5,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D452\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D452\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtd\" transform=\"translate(3052,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D453\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D453\"></use></g></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4477,0)\"><use data-c=\"239E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-S4-239E\" transform=\"translate(0,996)\"></use><use data-c=\"23A0\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-S4-23A0\" transform=\"translate(0,-1006)\"></use><svg width=\"875\" height=\"322\" y=\"89\" x=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 63.7 875 322\"><use data-c=\"239F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-S4-239F\" transform=\"scale(1,0.764)\"></use></svg></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>\n</p>\n<p>Notice that there are only 6 unique elements we need to fill because of the symmetry:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.023ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.197ex\" height=\"1.02ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -441 529 451\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D44E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44E\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> in the (1,1) position</li>\n<li><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.971ex\" height=\"1.595ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 429 705\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D44F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44F\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> in the (1,2) and (2,1) positions</li>\n<li><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.98ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 433 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D450\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D450\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> in the (1,3) and (3,1) positions</li>\n<li><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.023ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.183ex\" height=\"1.593ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 523 704\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> in the (2,2) position</li>\n<li><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.054ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 466 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D452\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D452\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> in the (2,3) and (3,2) positions</li>\n<li><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.464ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.244ex\" height=\"2.059ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 550 910\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D453\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D453\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> in the (3,3) position</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Each of these unique elements can take a value from the set <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.439ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20.367ex\" height=\"1.971ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -677 9002 871\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(944.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1444.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1889.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2389.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2834,0)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3334,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3778.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4278.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(4723.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(5223.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(5668,0)\"><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(6168,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(6612.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"37\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-37\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(7112.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(7557.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"38\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-38\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(8057.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(8502,0)\"><use data-c=\"39\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-39\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, which has 10 elements. </p>\n<p>We have 10 choices for each of the 6 unique elements, so the total number of symmetric matrices can be calculated as:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"33.67ex\" height=\"2.005ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -864 14882.3 886\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\">